    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78149" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-κελεύομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>recommend</i> an action to one, <i>prescribe</i>, 
