					Hdt.
					1.120
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				28.15
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα π.</span>
