				530
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				31b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινί</span> c.
			inf., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				221a
			</span></i>, al.; 
